= First East River Campaign

Chen Jiongming is an enigma to us. After successfully defeating the Old Guangxi Clique and taking Guangdong for us, he eventually betrayed us over disagreements in the Northern Expedition.

Now, the National Revolutionary Army has reached heights never seen by warlord armies. Due to Sun's ailing health, our borders now feel more unsafe.

Thus, we finally have a chance to beat him. We will begin an expedition to oust Chen Jiongming and unify Guangdong once and for all!

